                                                "sense_id": "618a751d-35d2-3018-afff-25d82c86a6f7",
                                                "text": "In the Atlanta suburb of Lilburn, ICE agents arrested Walter Valladares, a 53-year-old undocumented immigrant from Honduras, according to family members who spoke with CNN."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8b62d75-b866-4eb2-89d7-2038fe0a5198",
                                                "sense_id": "618a751d-35d2-3018-afff-25d82c86a6f7",
                                                "text": "Three children who are US citizens, including a 4-year-old receiving treatment for metastatic cancer, were taken to Honduras with their mothers, who were deported last week, according to the families’ attorneys and civil rights and immigration advocacy organizations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
